{'symbol': 'TFC', 'date': '2022-09-07 08:30:00', 'title': 'TRUIST NAMES MIKE MAGUIRE AS CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER', 'text': "CHARLOTTE, N.C. , SEPT. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRUIST FINANCIAL CORPORATION (NYSE: TFC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MIKE MAGUIRE, TRUIST'S CHIEF CONSUMER FINANCE AND PAYMENTS OFFICER, HAS BEEN NAMED CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER (CFO) EFFECTIVE SEPT."}